<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 7.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    93/94     97/98	UNQ     197/201</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/98    102/103   195/200   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices held steady on Monday in thin talks. Some suppliers offered the 380-cst grade at above $100 per tonne in earlier trade but they had to lower their prices as shipowners, expecting the weak cargo market to add pressure to bunker prices, stayed sidelined, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
